[[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237627\">1088C12</a></p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237489\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the lower coolant outlet hose from the radiator and\ndrain the engine coolant.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Manually press the springs and\nremove the rapid attachment for the hose.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the coolant using a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014756.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the water pump (1b) complete with\nO-ring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014757.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the water pump (1a), complete with O-Ring, back in its\nhousing and secure it tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014758.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Connect the rapid attachment for the bottom\ncoolant outlet hose from the radiator.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237489\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237407\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237823\">1060G80</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <strong>- 7055B91 Right front WHEEL ARCH\nLINER - R.R.</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a>\n